{
  "schema": "plc-task-v1",
  "title": "在线光谱仪维护后的重新标定许可",
  "block": "FB_SpectrometerQualification",
  "target": "offline",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "text": "# Spectrometer recalibration after maintenance\n\n- **Difficulty:** Medium (medium)\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. Implement FB_SpectrometerQualification for measurement eligibility after maintenance of an online spectrometer. State 0 means waiting for calibration, 1 ready and 2 maintenance. Initially State=0, CalibReq=TRUE, MaintLamp=FALSE and MeasurePermit=FALSE.\n\n2. Maintenance=TRUE has priority and moves every state to 2. With Maintenance=FALSE, a pre-scan State of 2 must first move to 0, even if CalibDone=TRUE on the same call. A pre-scan State of 0 moves to 1 only when CalibDone=TRUE, otherwise remains 0. State 1 remains ready while not in maintenance.\n\n3. Perform at most one transition per call, using the pre-scan state. CalibReq is TRUE exactly when the updated State is 0; MaintLamp exactly when it is 2. MeasurePermit equals the current MeasureReq AND updated State=1.\n\n4. CalibDone is a completion level supplied by an external calibration module. No fresh edge is required; the specific constraint is that the maintenance-exit scan cannot skip state 0. Spectral fitting, calibration computation and physical measurement are outside scope.\n\n## Interface Definition\n\n| Direction | Variable/Field | Data Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Input | `Maintenance` | `BOOL` | Maintenance mode. |\n| Input | `CalibDone` | `BOOL` | External calibration-complete level. |\n| Input | `MeasureReq` | `BOOL` | Measurement request. |\n| Output | `State` | `USINT` | 0 waiting for calibration, 1 ready, 2 maintenance. |\n| Output | `CalibReq` | `BOOL` | Request the upstream calibration module. |\n| Output | `MaintLamp` | `BOOL` | Maintenance indication. |\n| Output | `MeasurePermit` | `BOOL` | Ordinary measurement eligibility. |"
    }
  ],
  "inputs": {
    "Maintenance": "BOOL",
    "CalibDone": "BOOL",
    "MeasureReq": "BOOL"
  },
  "outputs": {
    "State": "USINT",
    "CalibReq": "BOOL",
    "MaintLamp": "BOOL",
    "MeasurePermit": "BOOL"
  },
